ntry>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KINOMURA, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC INDUSTRIAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OBARA, TOSHIO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KINOMURA MASAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OBARA TOSHIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KINOMURA, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OBARA, TOSHIO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>The control voltage for a reverse gain characteristic of a signal power amplifier (101) is stored in a gate voltage storage table (103), read from the gate voltage storage table (103) in response to a linear control voltage, and applied to the control electrode of the power amplifier (101). Thereby the gain characteristic and reverse gain characteristic are averaged, and hence the gain is made linear.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Selon l'invention, une tension de commande, pour une caractéristique de gain inverse d'un amplificateur de puissance de signal (101), est stockée dans un tableau de mémorisation de tension de grille (103), extraite du tableau de mémorisation de tension de grille (103) en réaction à une tension de commande linéaire, et appliquée à une électrode de commande de l'amplificateur de puissance (101). Ainsi, la moyenne de la caractéristique de gain et de la caractéristique de gain inverse est établie, et à partir de cette moyenne le gain est rendu linéaire.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>